}
```
The `getResult` method in `GeoPointVisitor` should handle cases where both `minNegX` and `maxPosX` (or vice versa) are infinite, which could lead to incorrect results.
```java
@Override
public Rectangle getResult() {
    if (Double.isInfinite(maxY)) {
        return null;
    } else if (Double.isInfinite(minPosX) && Double.isInfinite(maxNegX)) {
